# The protocol service, the system's only IP parser: both frame rings
# to the driver and both segment rings to bin/tcpd (16 pages each), its
# report and read-only configuration pages, the endpoint sockets are
# served on, and three notifications -- the driver's doorbell, its own
# inbox, and the bell that wakes bin/tcpd.
package ipd
version 0.1.0

program bin/ipd
entry hertz
cap memory pages=16
cap memory pages=16
cap memory pages=16
cap memory pages=16
cap memory pages=1
cap memory pages=1
cap serve net
cap notification
cap notification
cap notification

payload bin/ipd from user/ipd/target/x86_64-unknown-none/release/ipd
